{"reviews":[{"id":"B008PUU6RY-0","r":3.0,"t":"Good and bad","x":"I gave it 3 stars because Nenuco reminds me of my childhood back in the Philippines. This cologne was a go to for all the moms, babies and teenagers. The scent is the same but it doesn't last. It seems like it was watered down of some sort. I think I will keept it just as a mist. Maybe a pick me up mist if I needed to freshen up. It smells good but just for 5 minutes.","h":18,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B008PUU6RY-1","r":1.0,"t":"No es el original y no se puede devolver","x":"El pote grande no es el original. lo se porque lo utilizo nenuco con mi beb\u00e9.el pote peque\u00f1o si es el original. el olor del grande no es igual al peque\u00f1o ,casi ni tiene fragancia es como mezclado y lo peor es que no se puede devolver no pierdas tu dinero","h":12,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B008PUU6RY-2","r":5.0,"t":"Muy bueno","x":"Buen olor muy rico lo uso hacen 30 a\u00f1os para mis hijos","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B008PUU6RY-3","r":5.0,"t":"Made for Big Babies Too..!","x":"I discovered this stuff in Spain several years ago, it's made for babies but really used just as much by adults, in Spain anyway. It's a fresh mix of lemon, maybe ginger & other floral notes. It smells great without being 'cologney'..Isplash it on after my morning shave & the women in my office all want to 'smell me' when I walk in, can't really complain about that. There is a smaller bottle, I think \"Eau de cologne\" which is more concentrated & lingers a bit longer like cologne, maybe better fo","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B008PUU6RY-4","r":5.0,"t":"Like this product","x":"I like Nenuco and I am glad I can be able to buy this product. Especially now that there are travel restrictions due the Covid.  I use to buy it at the local grocery stores like Mercadona, SuperSol, AlCampo, Carrefour, or Coviran,  in Spain. Of course they are in many stores there.  The smell is so calming and refreshing. The scent of lemon, orange blossom.  Reminds me when I was in Spain.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B008PUU6RY-5","r":5.0,"t":"la mejor colonia de ninos","x":"desde siempre esta colonia nos ha gustad, asi que la recomiendo 100%","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B008PUU6RY-6","r":5.0,"t":"Weak longevity but its def worth it","x":"Cheap price for 2 big bottles of splash cologne, yes? Then you probably have an idea about its weak longevity (2 hours max on clothing) Smells very fresh and very clean as always. Brings back happy childhood memories! Won't hurt your bank to keep a little sprayer with you & refresh every 2 hrs. Still worth it. I'd still buy them after these 2 bottles.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B008PUU6RY-7","r":5.0,"t":"The proc was great ......","x":"I could take a bath in this ...I love love love always put this on my babies now they're grown and they still use it.... My Grandfather was from Galicia Spain ..I bough it when on vacation Manny years ago... This smell brings me back....","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B008PUU6RY-8","r":3.0,"t":"I love the smell of nenuco","x":"One of the bottles leaked in the packaging. They reimbursed me for it, but it leaked everywhere! I love the smell of nenuco, brings me back to my childhood.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2015"},{"id":"B008PUU6RY-9","r":5.0,"t":"Everyday","x":"I have used this and known of this product as a child in Spain. Use it everyday and sprinkle it my sheets when putting fresh sheets on","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2023"},{"id":"B008PUU6RY-10","r":2.0,"t":"Not original","x":"This is not Nenuco from Spain. Different bottle. One bottle had more than the other. I wonder if this are originals.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B008PUU6RY-11","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Same great scent I grew up wearing in Puerto Rico.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2015"},{"id":"B008PUU6RY-12","r":5.0,"t":"Great product, made for infants. Comes from Italy as far as I know.","x":"The fragrance is fresh and pleasant. It\u2019s not heavy or to perfumed. Once it\u2019s on it mellows out a bit and becomes more subtle. It\u2019s not ever overpowering. It comes out of the bottle fast, so I put it into a small spray bottle I bought from the dollar store. It\u2019s awesome, doesn\u2019t stain either.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2023"},{"id":"B008PUU6RY-13","r":5.0,"t":"Just twist the cap to use it: dont puncture it","x":"I like the scent of this cologne! its very fresh and suitable not only during summer but everyday \ud83d\udc95 Its not perfume so it wont the last whole day but the fresh, clean scent is very noticeable. I would say the price is worth it because its already 600 mL. Thumbs up!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B008PUU6RY-14","r":5.0,"t":"Clean and amazing","x":"This cologne smells clean and amazing. It is not overpowering.  I put it in a small spray bottle and it lasts awhile.  I only wish that it wasn't overpriced on here and more readily available. You can get a bottle in a South Florida store for 7.00","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Mar 2016"},{"id":"B008PUU6RY-15","r":5.0,"t":"All time favorite","x":"I love nenuco since my younger year 1980\u2019s and now even I am 46 years old now I still love the smell and remember my younger years. Thanks for still having this and I will surely buy this scent again for the rest of my life.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2022"},{"id":"B008PUU6RY-16","r":5.0,"t":"Amo esta colonia","x":"Desde que sal\u00ed de espa\u00f1a no la hab\u00eda encontrado m\u00e1s. Compre este pack de dos y solo con abrir la caja ol\u00eda a infancia !!!!!! Crec\u00ed con esta colina y a mis 41 a\u00f1os sigue siendo  mi preferida para despu\u00e9s de la ducha...","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2023"},{"id":"B008PUU6RY-17","r":5.0,"t":"My favorite cologne","x":"This is my cologne since i was in highschool, now I'm in 40's i still love this scent,  I'm glad i found these on Amazon...\ud83d\ude0a","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B008PUU6RY-18","r":5.0,"t":"Label","x":"I am kinda disappointed because label is not the same as on the picture.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B008PUU6RY-19","r":5.0,"t":"Colonia de beb\u00e9","x":"Una colonia perfecta para perfumar a mi beb\u00e9 la mejor calidad.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B008PUU6RY-20","r":5.0,"t":"Smells great!!","x":"Gotta love Nenuco!! One of my favorite after shower cologne.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B008PUU6RY-21","r":3.0,"t":"It's just like a water","x":"Smell doesn't stay . It's just like a water.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B008PUU6RY-22","r":5.0,"t":"Love it love it !!!!","x":"Pkg arrived promptly and was as expected","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B008PUU6RY-23","r":5.0,"t":"From babies to adults","x":"There's nothing to dislike about this product. From the smell, to the quantity you receive to the value. Its a great smelling cologne, that babies, and mama's can use. when you first spray it all you smell is citrus and then as it warms into your skin some of that citrus becomes sweet. Not sickening sweet but a sweet and almost floral fragrance with a citrus note always present. This for staying power would be best applied to clothes instead of skin. I decanted some of the product into a spray b","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B008PUU6RY-24","r":5.0,"t":"Freshest smell I know! I use in a spray bottle all day long, great mister \u2764\ufe0f","x":"I\u2019m from London originally but moved state side 33 years ago but my child hood scent memories come from vacations in Spain and a fresh scent that we always loved, the \u201cbaby cologne\u201d! I just rediscovered it thanks to good old goog \u2764\ufe0f And am on my 6th bottle in about 6 months \ud83d\ude33 Love this stuff still after 50 years! So glad to have rediscovered! One criticism, you should sell it in a spray bottle! \ud83d\ude09","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently describe the scent as fresh, clean, and pleasant, and many say it is not overpowering.","cites":[4,7,13,14,15]},{"text":"Many reviewers associate the cologne with childhood memories and nostalgia, often from Spain, Puerto Rico, or the Philippines.","cites":[1,7,8,9,10,12]},{"text":"A common complaint is that the scent does not last long and fades quickly.","cites":[1,7,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers suspect the product is not the original or is watered down, and some report leaking or inconsistent bottles.","cites":[1,2,9,11]},{"text":"Some reviewers find it overpriced or note it is cheaper and more available in stores.","cites":[2,15]}]},"qa":[]}